{@see MembershipEventPublisher}: when a node is declared {@see NodeDown}, fails every\nin-flight ask targeting it before forwarding the event. The inbound-link onClose path already\nfails asks on a socket close, but a phi-accrual Down (a black-holed\/half-open peer that never\nsends EOF) produces no socket close \u2014 so without this the reply can never arrive yet the awaiting\ncaller parks until its per-ask timeout. Failing on the authoritative Down decision closes that gap.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:72:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\AskFailingMembershipEventPublisher\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:62:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEventPublisher\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:85:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/AskFailingMembershipEventPublisher.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:19;}s:4:\"type\";E:61:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:IMPLEMENTS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:5:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:62:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEventPublisher