urrent\nreachable-member count and the required floor so an operator can alert on lost quorum.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\ClusterDegraded\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEvent\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/ClusterDegraded.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:15;}s:4:\"type\";E:61:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:IMPLEMENTS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:344:\"\n\nEmitted while the node is below its configured minimum-members floor\n({@see \\Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\ClusterTopology::withMinimumMembers()}): it has stopped\ndeclaring peers Down to avoid a split-brain minority evicting the majority. Carries the current\nreachable-member count and the required floor so an operator can alert on lost quorum.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/ClusterDegraded.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/ClusterView.php