bershipEventPublisher} to maintain a set of peers currently considered\ndeparted (Down): a peer is added on {@see NodeDown} and removed again on {@see NodeUp}. This\npowers {@see \\Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Messaging\\ClusterRef::isAlive()} without any blocking\ncall \u2014 the ref factory is handed an {@see self::isAlive()} probe that consults this in-memory set.\n\nThread-confinement: the set is only ever mutated on the membership actor's own event-publishing\npath (this decorator wraps the actor's publisher) and only ever read from the recv\/membership\nevent loop, so no locking is required \u2014 matching the package convention for the mutable\nPhiAccrualDetector and liveness collaborators.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:70:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/DepartedPeerTracker.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:2:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:34:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\NodeAddress\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:70:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/DepartedPeerTracker.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:8:\"Override\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContex