the rejection and `view`\nis empty. When accepted, `view` carries a node path-prefix \u2192 host:port snapshot\nof the local view after merge.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:68:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/HandshakeResponse.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:1:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:34:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\NodeAddress\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:68:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/HandshakeResponse.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/LivenessThrottle.php":{"hash":"9a718eab5d8a429d1b006975b477ba83e0ffe4e3","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:1239:\"\n\nCoalesces per-frame liveness signals into at most one observation per peer per\ninterval.\n\nEvery inbound frame proves the peer is alive, but forwarding a\n{@see Message\\PeerLivenessObserved} to the membership actor for EVERY frame is\nboth wasted work and a reliability hazard: under sustained message load the\nmembership mailbox fills with tens of thousands of liveness messages per second,\neach costing a clock read, a phi-detector update, and a ClusterView rebuild \u2014\nand gossip\/tick processing queues behind them, so the failure detector reads\nstale arrival times exactly when the cluster is busiest (risking false suspicion\nunder load). The phi detector itself discards inter-arrival samples closer than\n{@see PhiAccrualDetector::MIN_SAMPLE_INTERVAL_MS} anyway, so beats above that\nrate carry no detection value at all.\n\nThe default interval therefore mirrors the detector's sample floor: one\nobservation per peer per 50 ms preserves full failure-detection fidelity while\nbounding membership-actor traffic to at most 20 messages per peer per second.\n\nPure state machine over caller-supplied monotonic nanoseconds (no clock inside)\nso it is deterministic to test; {@see \\Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\ClusterNode}\nfeeds it `hrtime(true)`.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:54:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\LivenessThrottle\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:1:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:56:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\PhiAccrualDetector\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:67:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/LivenessThrottle.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:39;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:56:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:CONST\";}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:1239:\"\n\nCoalesces per-frame liveness signals into at most one observation per peer per\ninterval.\n\nEvery inbound frame proves the peer is alive, but forwarding a\n{@see Message\\PeerLivenessObserved} to the membership actor for EVERY frame is\nboth wasted work and a reliability hazard: under sustained message load the\nmembership mailbox fills with tens of thousands of liveness messages per second,\neach costing a clock read, a phi-detector update, and a ClusterView rebuild \u2014\nand gossip\/tick processing queues behind them, so the failure detector reads\nstale arrival times exactly when the cluster is busiest (risking false suspicion\nunder load). The phi detector itself discards inter-arrival samples closer than\n{@see PhiAccrualDetector::MIN_SAMPLE_INTERVAL_MS} anyway, so beats above that\nrate carry no detection value at all.\n\nThe default interval therefore mirrors the detector's sample floor: one\nobservation per peer per 50 ms preserves full failure-detection fidelity while\nbounding membership-actor traffic to at most 20 messages per peer per second.\n\nPure state machine over caller-supplied monotonic nanoseconds (no clock inside)\nso it is deterministic to test; {@see \\Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\ClusterNode}\nfeeds it `hrtime(true)`.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:67:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/LivenessThrottle.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php":{"hash":"24e71387f054f305b0a2a66510576fae2af62f92","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:287:\"\n\nImmutable snapshot of one cluster member's identity, network endpoint, and\nliveness. `incarnation` monotonically increases each time a node rejoins,\nletting the gossip layer supersede stale entries. `status` + `lastSeen`\ncapture the local view's most recent judgement about the member.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:50:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MemberRecord\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:6:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:34:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\NodeAddress\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:22;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:PARAMETER\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:39:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\NodeEndpoint\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:23;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:50:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MemberStatus\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:25;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}i:3;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:26;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}i:4;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:50:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MemberStatus\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:29;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}i:5;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:29;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:287:\"\n\nImmutable snapshot of one cluster member's identity, network endpoint, and\nliveness. `incarnation` monotonically increases each time a node rejoins,\nletting the gossip layer supersede stale entries. `status` + `lastSeen`\ncapture the local view's most recent judgement about the member.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:3:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:34:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\NodeAddress\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:8;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:74;}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:39:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\NodeEndpoint\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberRecord.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:9;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:74;}}}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberStatus.php":{"hash":"7b1fcbc72e27c8fe572e90c3d282018405b621b4","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:494:\"\n\nLifecycle status of a cluster member as tracked by the local MembershipService.\n\n  - Up      \u2014 reachable; heartbeats arriving and phi below threshold.\n  - Suspect \u2014 provisionally unreachable (phi exceeded threshold or link closed\n              unexpectedly); still a candidate for recovery.\n  - Down    \u2014 declared dead after the reconnect give-up window; removed on Leave.\n\nMerge tie-breaking uses `rank()`: a worse (higher-rank) status wins when two\nrecords share the same incarnation.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:64:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASSLIKE\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:50:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MemberStatus\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:494:\"\n\nLifecycle status of a cluster member as tracked by the local MembershipService.\n\n  - Up      \u2014 reachable; heartbeats arriving and phi below threshold.\n  - Suspect \u2014 provisionally unreachable (phi exceeded threshold or link closed\n              unexpectedly); still a candidate for recovery.\n  - Down    \u2014 declared dead after the reconnect give-up window; removed on Leave.\n\nMerge tie-breaking uses `rank()`: a worse (higher-rank) status wins when two\nrecords share the same incarnation.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:63:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MemberStatus.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEffect.php":{"hash":"bddafd9aa03a8db007735b51b47dd532a97ef41d","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:307:\"\n\nMarker for an outbound action produced by a membership transition. Concrete\neffects: HandshakeResponse (reply to a connecting peer), SendGossip\n(anti-entropy gossip round). The owning actor (C1.6d) executes effects; the\ntransition only returns them \u2014 no I\/O is performed inside the transition\nfunctions.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:64:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_INTERFACE\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:54:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEffect\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:307:\"\n\nMarker for an outbound action produced by a membership transition. Concrete\neffects: HandshakeResponse (reply to a connecting peer), SendGossip\n(anti-entropy gossip round). The owning actor (C1.6d) executes effects; the\ntransition only returns them \u2014 no I\/O is performed inside the transition\nfunctions.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:67:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEffect.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEffectInterpreter.php":{"hash":"f16edbd2f48314a7fffa84a83f1dcba0a2c2de0c","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:438:\"\n\nExecutes the outbound effects a membership transition produces. The\nMembershipActor delegates every {@see MembershipEffect} it receives from a\ntransition to this seam, keeping the actor free of transport wiring.\n\nC1.6e supplies the real implementation: it resolves each HandshakeResponse \/\nSendGossip target path-prefix to a live TCP endpoint and performs the send\nvia the cluster transport \/ OutboundSink. Tests use a recording double.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:64:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_INTERFACE\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:65:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEffectInterpreter\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:1:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:54:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEffect\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEffectInterpreter.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:20;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:PARAMETER\";}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:438:\"\n\nExecutes the outbound effects a membership transition produces. The\nMembershipActor delegates every {@see MembershipEffect} it receives from a\ntransition to this seam, keeping the actor free of transport wiring.\n\nC1.6e supplies the real implementation: it resolves each HandshakeResponse \/\nSendGossip target path-prefix to a live TCP endpoint and performs the send\nvia the cluster transport \/ OutboundSink. Tests use a recording double.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEffectInterpreter.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEvent.php":{"hash":"70df1bc8f2dc6636a9cc2c31294fb6d8f9e42f8f","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:238:\"\n\nMarker for a membership transition emitted by MembershipService and delivered\nto `onViewChange` listeners. Concrete events: NodeUp, NodeDown, NodeSuspected.\nThe ClusterNode layer (C1.6) fans these out to PSR-14 + observability counters.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:64:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_INTERFACE\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEvent\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:238:\"\n\nMarker for a membership transition emitted by MembershipService and delivered\nto `onViewChange` listeners. Concrete events: NodeUp, NodeDown, NodeSuspected.\nThe ClusterNode layer (C1.6) fans these out to PSR-14 + observability counters.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEvent.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventDeduplicator.php":{"hash":"010283102958399c7789f9391999ea9c36d16c6a","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:1460:\"\n\nSuppresses duplicate membership announcements so subscribers see each net state\nchange exactly once.\n\nIn a gossip mesh one transient suspicion echoes: stale views keep re-teaching the\nsame (peer, incarnation) status through merges until the suspected node's\nincarnation refutation propagates \u2014 a 16-node soak measured suspected=25\u2013133 per\nnode per 5 minutes with only 0\u20133 locally-detected events (conn=0, phi=0\u20133). The\nVIEW self-heals and delivery is unaffected; the event layer over-reports.\n\nPolicy \u2014 per peer, this deduplicator tracks what was last ANNOUNCED and filters:\n  1. News for an OLDER incarnation than already announced is suppressed (pure echo).\n  2. A HIGHER incarnation always publishes immediately and resets the slate \u2014\n     refutations are never delayed.\n  3. Within the announced incarnation, a repeat of the announced status is\n     suppressed (the subscriber already believes it); a status CHANGE always\n     publishes \u2014 a recovery NodeUp is never lost.\n  4. After a Down, same-incarnation readmission churn (stale gossip re-adding the\n     member as Suspect\/Up, then re-Down) is suppressed for `downQuietPeriod`\n     (default 30 s); a genuine rejoin arrives either after the quiet period or \u2014\n     once C2 wires rejoin \u2014 at a higher incarnation, and publishes.\n\nConfined to the membership actor (same discipline as {@see PhiAccrualDetector});\nfilters what is PUBLISHED and counted, never what the view transitions to.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:65:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEventDeduplicator\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:6:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:31:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Runtime\\Duration\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventDeduplicator.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:56;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:64:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:STATIC_METHOD\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:31:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Runtime\\Duration\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventDeduplicator.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:54;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:PARAMETER\";}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\De