s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:1460:\"\n\nSuppresses duplicate membership announcements so subscribers see each net state\nchange exactly once.\n\nIn a gossip mesh one transient suspicion echoes: stale views keep re-teaching the\nsame (peer, incarnation) status through merges until the suspected node's\nincarnation refutation propagates \u2014 a 16-node soak measured suspected=25\u2013133 per\nnode per 5 minutes with only 0\u20133 locally-detected events (conn=0, phi=0\u20133). The\nVIEW self-heals and delivery is unaffected; the event layer over-reports.\n\nPolicy \u2014 per peer, this deduplicator tracks what was last ANNOUNCED and filters:\n  1. News for an OLDER incarnation than already announced is suppressed (pure echo).\n  2. A HIGHER incarnation always publishes immediately and resets the slate \u2014\n     refutations are never delayed.\n  3. Within the announced incarnation, a repeat of the announced status is\n     suppressed (the subscriber already believes it); a status CHANGE always\n     publishes \u2014 a recovery NodeUp is never lost.\n  4. After a Down, same-incarnation readmission churn (stale gossip re-adding the\n     member as Suspect\/Up, then re-Down) is suppressed for `downQuietPeriod`\n     (default 30 s); a genuine rejoin arrives either after the quiet period or \u2014\n     once C2 wires rejoin \u2014 at a higher incarnation, and publishes.\n\nConfined to the membership actor (same discipline as {@see PhiAccrualDetector});\nfilters what is PUBLISHED and counted, never what the view transitions to.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventDeduplicator.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:2:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventDeduplicator.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:31:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Runtime\\Duration\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:78:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventDeduplicator.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:8;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:74;}}}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventPublisher.php":{"hash":"a17b842924f1ea6c589b39b83484eba00852bc14","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:355:\"\n\nPublishes the {@see MembershipEvent}s a transition emits. The MembershipActor\nfans every event out through this seam so that observers (PSR-14 listeners,\nobservability counters) stay decoupled from the actor.\n\nC1.7 wires the real implementation onto PSR-14 + metrics; tests use a\nrecording double, and the default in the absence of listeners is a no-op.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:64:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_INTERFACE\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:62:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEventPublisher\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:1:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipEvent\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:75:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventPublisher.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:19;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:PARAMETER\";}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:355:\"\n\nPublishes the {@see MembershipEvent}s a transition emits. The MembershipActor\nfans every event out through this seam so that observers (PSR-14 listeners,\nobservability counters) stay decoupled from the actor.\n\nC1.7 wires the real implementation onto PSR-14 + metrics; tests use a\nrecording double, and the default in the absence of listeners is a no-op.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:75:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipEventPublisher.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:0:{}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipState.php":{"hash":"e464546af8217e4aa3ed822fc22c82cc6bd53b7f","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:582:\"\n\nThe MembershipActor's evolving state \u2014 the pure, replaceable portion of the\nmembership machine (everything the C1.5 service kept mutable except the\nPhiAccrualDetector, which stays a thread-confined actor collaborator).\n\nThe actor replaces this wholesale after each transition via\n{@see BehaviorWithState::next()}:\n  - $view            \u2014 the current ClusterView snapshot.\n  - $suspectSince    \u2014 when each peer entered Suspect, keyed by path-prefix;\n                       drives the applyTick give-up window.\n  - $selfIncarnation \u2014 local incarnation, bumped by applyRejoin.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipState\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:3:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipState.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:28;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:PARAMETER\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:49:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\ClusterView\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipState.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:28;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:58:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipTransition\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipState.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:33;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:582:\"\n\nThe MembershipActor's evolving state \u2014 the pure, replaceable portion of the\nmembership machine (everything the C1.5 service kept mutable except the\nPhiAccrualDetector, which stays a thread-confined actor collaborator).\n\nThe actor replaces this wholesale after each transition via\n{@see BehaviorWithState::next()}:\n  - $view            \u2014 the current ClusterView snapshot.\n  - $suspectSince    \u2014 when each peer entered Suspect, keyed by path-prefix;\n                       drives the applyTick give-up window.\n  - $selfIncarnation \u2014 local incarnation, bumped by applyRejoin.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipState.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:1:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipState.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}}}"},"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipTransition.php":{"hash":"bd6e738c901b317ed5ab4d5360ba10df7e5e61e9","reference":"O:49:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileReference\":4:{s:19:\"classLikeReferences\";a:1:{i:0;O:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\":7:{s:62:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\TaggedTokenReference\u0000tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:598:\"\n\nResult of a pure membership state transition. Carries the complete new state\nthe actor must adopt, the MembershipEvents to broadcast, and the\nMembershipEffects to execute.\n\nSeparation of concerns:\n  - newView \/ newSuspectSince \/ newSelfIncarnation \u2192 actor replaces its state.\n  - events   \u2192 actor fans out to PSR-14 \/ observability counters.\n  - effects  \u2192 actor executes I\/O (TCP sends, acks).\n\n`newSuspectSince` records when each peer entered Suspect status, keyed by\nNodeAddress path-prefix. The actor must track this across transitions so that\napplyTick can evaluate the give-up window.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contra