gs\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:644:\"\n\nTransport-backed {@see OutboundSink} that maintains one {@see PeerConnection} per resolved\npeer endpoint. Connections are created lazily on first send and reused thereafter.\n\nFor each send:\n  1. Resolve the target {@see NodeAddress} to a {@see NodeEndpoint} via the injected\n     {@see EndpointResolver}.\n  2. Pack the {@see MessagePayload} to bytes via the hand-rolled {@see MessagePayloadCodec}.\n  3. Wrap the bytes in a {@see FrameType::Message} frame and enqueue it on the peer's\n     {@see PeerConnection} (which handles buffering and reconnect automatically).\n\nUnresolvable endpoints are silently dropped and counted via {@see drops()}.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Messaging\\MeshOutboundSink\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:49:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Messaging\\OutboundSink\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Messaging\/MeshOutboundSink.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:44;}s:4:\"type\";E:61:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:IMPLEMENTS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:27:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLik