the closure body, so\ncall sites see `WithStateBehavior<object, mixed>`. This hook extracts\nthe closure's second parameter (message type, U) and third parameter\n(state type, S) and rewrites the return to a properly narrowed generic.\n\nExample:\n\n    $b = Behavior::withState(\n        0,\n        static fn(ActorContext $ctx, Increment $msg, int $count) => ...,\n    );\n    \/\/ Without hook: WithStateBehavior<object, mixed>\n    \/\/ With hook:    WithStateBehavior<Increment, int>\n\nPartial inference is supported: a typed state with an `object` message\nstill returns `WithStateBehavior<object, int>` (narrower than the\ndefault). If the closure shape can't be inspected at all, the hook\nfalls through to Psalm's default.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:61:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Psalm\\Hook\\BehaviorWithStateReturnTypeProvider\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:59:\"Psalm\\Plugin\\EventHandler\\MethodReturnTypeProviderInterface\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:74:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-psalm\/src\/Hook\/BehaviorWithStateReturnTypeProvider.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:54;}s:4:\"type\";E:61:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:IMPLEMENTS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:27:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50