the closure's second parameter type to extract C\n\nand rewrites the return to `EntityBehaviorBuilder<T, C>`.\n\nExample:\n\n    $b = EntityBehavior::create(\n        entityClass: Order::class,\n        id: $id,\n        commandHandler: static fn(ActorContext $ctx, AddItem $cmd, Order $o): EntityEffect => EntityEffect::same(),\n    );\n    \/\/ Without hook: EntityBehaviorBuilder<object, object>\n    \/\/ With hook:    EntityBehaviorBuilder<Order, AddItem>\n\nWhen either generic cannot be narrowed (e.g. the class-string is a\nvariable or the closure param is untyped), the hook falls through to\nPsalm's default inference.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:58:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Psalm\\Hook\\EntityBehaviorReturnTypeProvider\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:59:\"Psalm\\Plugin\\EventHandler\\MethodReturnTypeProviderInterface\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:71:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-psalm\/src\/Hook\/EntityBehaviorReturnTypeProvider.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:57;}s:4:\"type\";E:61:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:IMPLEMENTS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:23:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\