ip actor. Owns the {@see MembershipState} (ClusterView +\nsuspectSince + selfIncarnation) and evolves it functionally by dispatching\neach inbound message to the matching pure {@see MembershipService} transition,\nthen adopting the returned state via {@see BehaviorWithState::next()}.\n\nThe transition returns a {@see MembershipTransition} carrying the new state,\nthe {@see MembershipEvent}s to publish, and the {@see MembershipEffect}s to\nexecute. The actor publishes every event through the injected\n{@see MembershipEventPublisher} and hands every effect to the injected\n{@see MembershipEffectInterpreter}; it performs no I\/O itself.\n\nThread-confinement: the mutable {@see PhiAccrualDetector} and the\n{@see PeerSelector} are actor collaborators (constructor-injected), not part\nof the replaceable state \u2014 they are only ever touched on the actor's own\nmessage-processing path, so no locking is required.\n\nScheduling: {@see self::props()} arranges the HeartbeatTick \/ GossipTick\nself-ticks via `scheduleRepeatedly` when the actor starts.\";}s:11:\"@implements\";a:1:{i:0;s:45:\"StatefulActorHandler<object, MembershipState>\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:53:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MembershipActor\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:46:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Core\\Actor\\StatefulActorHandler\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:66:\"\/a