stMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:50:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Membership\\MemberStatus\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:68:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipService.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:684;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:91;}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:1622:\"\n\nPure membership transition functions. Each method takes the current membership\nstate (ClusterView, suspectSince timestamps, self incarnation) plus an event\ninput, applies the appropriate state-machine logic, and returns a\nMembershipTransition describing the new state, emitted events, and outbound\neffects. No I\/O is performed; the owning actor (C1.6d) executes the effects.\n\nThe PhiAccrualDetector is mutable and owned by the actor; it is passed in to\nliveness\/tick transitions so that heartbeat timestamps are recorded (the\ndetector's phi calculation requires every arrival to be fed in).\n\nState the actor must track across transitions:\n  - ClusterView                      \u2014 returned as newView in every transition.\n  - array<string,DateTimeImmutable>  \u2014 returned as newSuspectSince; records when\n                                       each peer entered Suspect so applyTick can\n                                       evaluate the give-up window.\n  - int $selfIncarnation             \u2014 returned as newSelfIncarnation; bumped by\n                                       applyRejoin.\n\nTransitions:\n  - applyHandshake  \u2014 validate peer, record liveness, merge view \u2192 HandshakeResponse effect.\n  - applyGossip     \u2014 decode enriched GossipPayload, merge view.\n  - applyLiveness   \u2014 record any inbound frame (frame \/ ping \/ pong), feed detector.\n  - applyLinkClosed \u2014 suspect peer on unexpected close; no-op on intentional close.\n  - applyLeave      \u2014 remove peer immediately.\n  - applyRejoin     \u2014 bump local incarnation.\n  - applyTick       \u2014 phi failure detection + give-up window + SendGossip effect.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:68:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipService.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:7:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:68:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipService.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:24:\"InvalidArgumentException\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:68:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/MembershipService.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:8;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:1274;}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\Cl