psed))` where `P` is the tail\nprobability of the elapsed time under a normal distribution fitted to the\nwindow. A higher phi means the peer is more likely dead; callers compare it to\na threshold (default 8.0).\n\nThe normal tail is computed directly (Abramowitz & Stegun 26.2.17) rather than\nas `1 - CDF`, avoiding catastrophic cancellation deep in the tail so phi keeps\nclimbing past the threshold instead of saturating.\n\nA standard-deviation floor (`minStdDev`, default 500 ms) keeps phi bounded when\narrivals are near-perfectly periodic (otherwise stddev \u2192 0 and phi explodes on\nthe first late beat).\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:69:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/PhiAccrualDetector.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:2:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:69:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Membership\/PhiAccrualDetector.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:24:\"InvalidArgumentException\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":