e RTT.\n\n`cluster.send` and `cluster.ask` spans are opened around each outbound publish; both are\nswallow-safe so a broken tracer never disrupts message delivery.\nSelf-node short-circuits produce no span.\";}s:9:\"@template\";a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"T of object\";}s:11:\"@implements\";a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"ActorRef<T>\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:47:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\Tcp\\Messaging\\ClusterRef\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:34:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Core\\Actor\\ActorRef\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:60:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Messaging\/ClusterRef.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:47;}s:4:\"type\";E:61:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:IMPLEMENTS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:45:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:45:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Observability\\Trace\\NoopTracer\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:60:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Messaging\/ClusterRef