returns a {@see Future} that\nresolves on the reply frame or fails with {@see AskTimeoutException} after one RTT.\n\n`cluster.send` and `cluster.ask` spans are opened around each outbound publish; both are\nswallow-safe so a broken tracer never disrupts message delivery.\nSelf-node short-circuits produce no span.\";}s:9:\"@template\";a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"T of object\";}s:11:\"@implements\";a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"ActorRef<T>\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:60:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Messaging\/ClusterRef.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:20:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:7:\"Closure\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:60:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Messaging\/ClusterRef.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:USE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:34:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Cluster\\NodeAddress\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:60:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-cluster-tcp\/src\/Messaging\/ClusterRef.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:8;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:402;}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2