ht request.\n\ngetAll() returns static \u2295 coroutine (coroutine wins on duplicate keys).\n\nValues are log-safe primitives: scalars, Stringable objects, or null \u2014\nanything the formatters can interpolate or JSON-encode losslessly.\n\nWithout ext-swoole loaded the coroutine tier transparently disables and\neverything falls back to the static tier.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:25:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\Logger\\Mdc\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:17:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:10:\"Stringable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:38:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-logger\/src\/Mdc.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:49;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:59:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:VARIABLE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:10:\"Stringable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:38:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-logger\/src\/Mdc.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:57;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Cont