ntext\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:64:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-logger\/src\/Monolog\/MonologHandlerAdapter.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:83;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:107;}}}s:4:\"tags\";a:1:{s:10:\"@psalm-api\";a:1:{i:0;s:693:\"\n\nDrops any Monolog HandlerInterface into the nexus-logger pipeline.\n\nEach nexus Record is converted to a Monolog LogRecord, then forwarded\nto the wrapped handler. Because nexus-logger's actor invokes Handler::handle\non its own turn (not the caller's), the wrapped Monolog handler's I\/O\ncost stays off the request path.\n\nUsage:\n\n  use Monolog\\Handler\\RotatingFileHandler;\n  use Monolog\\Handler\\SyslogHandler;\n\n  NexusLogger::create($system, 'app')\n      ->handler(new MonologHandlerAdapter(new RotatingFileHandler('\/var\/log\/app.log', 7)))\n      ->handler(new MonologHandlerAdapter(new SyslogHandler('app')))\n      ->build();\n\nSoft-depends on monolog\/monolog ^3.0; install separately when used.\";}}s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000fileReference\";r:1;}}s:18:\"functionReferences\";a:0:{}s:8:\"filepath\";s:64:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-logger\/src\/Monolog\/MonologHandlerAdapter.php\";s:12:\"dependencies\";a:8:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"DateTimeImmutable\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:64:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-logger\/src\/Monolog\/MonologHandlerAdapter.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:7;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:54:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\Depend